## DeskHelper Pro 1.3.2

**Fixes**
- **Mirroring** — "Mirror Built-in to External Display" now reliably switches into mirror mode on a single click, instead of occasionally toggling straight back to no change.
- **Active Window Highlight** — the outline now appears correctly on macOS 26 (it was being suppressed by a false Mission Control detection).
- **Pointer & Scroll** — keyboards and other input devices are no longer mistaken for the active mouse, so the right device is selected automatically.

]]></description>
